10 REM WALKER: SPRITE SHEETS OVER A JPEG BACKDROP. ARROWS TURN, Q QUITS
20 REM SET UP THE PALETTE FIRST: SHEETS BRING THEIR OWN COLORS,
30 REM THEN THE BACKDROP IS DITHERED TO WHATEVER THE PALETTE HOLDS.
40 HGR
50 SHEET 0, "WALKER.PNG", 24, 32 PALETTE 232: SHEET 0 HOTSPOT 12, 31
60 SHEET 1, "STAR.PNG" PALETTE 240: SHEET 1 HOTSPOT 16, 16
70 PICTURE "VALLEY.JPG"
80 SPRITE 0 FRAME 0, 0: SPRITE 0 AT 300, 326: SPRITE 0 ANIMATE 0, 7, 4
90 D = 1: OD = 0
100 FOR I = 1 TO 3: SPRITE I FRAME 1, 0: SPRITE I AT 120 * I + 80, 60 + 20 * I
110 SPRITE I ROTATE 0, I * 2: SPRITE I SCALE 0.5 + I * 0.25: NEXT
120 K$ = INKEY$: X = SPRX(0)
130 IF K$ = CHR$(130) OR X > 620 THEN D = -1
140 IF K$ = CHR$(131) OR X < 20 THEN D = 1
150 IF K$ = "Q" OR K$ = "q" THEN 190
160 IF D <> OD THEN SPRITE 0 MOVE D * 1.5, 0: SPRITE 0 FLIP -(D < 0): OD = D
170 VSYNC
180 GOTO 120
190 FOR I = 0 TO 3: SPRITE I OFF: NEXT: VSYNC: TEXT
